      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『绝对不能输给\n抱着截然相反价值观而奔跑的爱如往昔』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7020e08a2f9789b0e62b6866fbb51818a71b1d6e55c3c7654f671736f0312ffc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976f2124107c984f391bf319",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而，在无法正确分析现状的当下，\n她无法让自己成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef355d91c6e471ecb0df9bb805a8bc7695633351fcda114e83e7ff54d821975c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0cc27cd2e23d50bed932b7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（那样……绝对不行……！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "89b75b8d5845f14eb71db84bf72a9f69cbbb1886520ca3b016a6e39fa10c294e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef59e83d605aca144a479d71",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若就这样无法进行正规训练便迎接『秋华赏』，\n结果恐怕会让她留下悔恨。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08c9cf74b5e6a42eec6eafc8a93d5c1e7887788d5e0a123c0158037f17ae4e02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7c8e7820d62eaaa83a3b9cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对她而言，与爱如往昔对决的『秋华赏』\n是赌上自身存在意义的最终战。而且――",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf28514e69155170decaa4b7eb846ee8ef268c8feef9e64021873858ef163c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:255b80ea27d7638c500f885c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e88d223082bc2147cfd17e9247f4910aa0440abb0769c9be2601dedcb144838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8874943f0b1dc843168eeab6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『期限是――正如她所言，直到三后冠赛结束』",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ac3804eed73da64ed9125eacb545e1cfaea894bffce1bb86260764825749a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1d1601f55867c4107f49b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e88d223082bc2147cfd17e9247f4910aa0440abb0769c9be2601dedcb144838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49d4dbe1bc38340cfa8f735e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『……签下吧。\n到与她做个了断为止――这份短暂的契约』",
      "source_fingerprint": "cab81154afdaf4b2282529506c551fcecb90ae04e93fb99408ae4f2198b370d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b1c33ed33f8196835c1a97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当时拒人于千里之外的她，\n正受到强大宿敌出现的威胁。",
      "source_fingerprint": "958e3bc6bcfffa20a831aa54a827cedea4a7697a4317ebb1d089bc8d7ca75439",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:342b63e865007db9b33bba70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了支持试图孤军奋战的她，\n我提出了符合她心意的契约条件。\n那就是直到『秋华赏』为止的期间限定契约。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff160b07816f4a5e655ae7a4234be1bff12e888bd80a41fa3fe414d5f059ec8b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebba93b3f730d217a1d28601",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想那时除此之外别无他法。\n即便如此――也无法回避迫在眉睫的现实。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd44ee163bd71d787054719c3205c0dec3c115f907c7b9fc210b35ae05830af4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3312dafc8b35ec831a13151a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『秋华赏』将是我能支持她的最后一场赛事。\n至少在那之前，我必须竭尽所能。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7939d418456bb12470b3b7391609e42d1413997a3b5a185ee9ce76d5a1627563",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b49b30e26a433e00f72e1b8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e88d223082bc2147cfd17e9247f4910aa0440abb0769c9be2601dedcb144838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441038b34e794c28af2c0d28",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "咔哈……哈啊……哈啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ff6b7f49e6b7eedfe6773cbdb8ff584369ff561588d70c191b72722b253c49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0be9c40232476c32f7efaca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动这份过于强烈的执念，\n在夏季合宿期间产生了更为深刻的影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a24a0d84aca0534849b9455c8d202e3be037cbd2b77a7ffbcb2bf707c3b07e69",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08e6d36b01ddcb7701d1f9d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕律动",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e88d223082bc2147cfd17e9247f4910aa0440abb0769c9be2601dedcb144838",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1118/storytimeline_501118103.json",
      "json_path": [
